  2008: "Lɑ bee nebã pʋgẽ sẽn yete: \"tõnd kõo sɩd ne Wẽnd lɑ Lɑɑhr dɑɑrã\". La b yɑool n pɑ sɩd-kõtb ye.",
  2009: "B zãmbdɑ Wẽnde, ne b rãmb nins sẽn kõ sɩdã, lɑ ad b pɑ zãmbd rallame tɩ yɑɑ b mens bɑlɑ, lɑ b pɑ ningd b yɑmẽ ye.",
  2010: "Bãɑg n be b sũyẽ wã tɩ Wẽnd pɑɑs-b bãɑgɑ, lɑ bãmb tɑrɑ nɑng sẽn zɑbde, b sẽn dɑ yɩ n yɑgdã yĩngɑ.",
