  82002: "La ãdsã sã n wa lʋɩtẽ.",
  82003: "La moagã sã n wa pus n yek tɑɑbɑ.",
  82004: "La kabɑ wã sã n wa bugsdẽ.",
  82005: "Yõor na bãng a sẽn tʋm tɩ reng taoor la a sẽn tʋm tɩ yaoole.",
  82006: "Yaa foo ninsaalã! Bõe n belg foom ne fo Soab wagellã,",
  82007: "Ning sẽn naan-a foo, n zems-f taab n tẽeg-f tɩrga?",
  82008: "Nɑɑnd ning A sẽn tʋll la A sigd foo.",
  82009: "Pa woto ye! Y kɩɩsda Rolbã raare.",
  82010: "La ad gũusdb n be yãmb zutu,",
