  83020: "Yaa karaas sẽn gʋls n sε, m pɑ toeemdẽ ye.",
  83021: "Malεgs pẽtbã sεεt-a lame.",
  83022: "Ad nin-sõmsã bee neema pʋgẽ.",
  83023: "B bee b gãas zut n getẽ.",
  83024: "F bãngda b nemsẽ wã neemɑ wã tagmase.",
