  83028: "Yaa ko nif tɩ nin-pẽtsã yũuda.",
  83029: "Ad nin-wẽnsã b ra yɩɩme n laad sɩd-kõtbã.",
  83030: "La b sã n pɩʋʋg-b la b sẽn yĩgisd-ba.",
