  84001: "Saagã sã n wa pãrge.",
  84002: "La a kεlg a Soabã n sɑk n tũ, la sεgda ne-a t'ɑ mɑɑn rẽ.",
  84003: "La Tẽngã B sã n wa yãbg-ɑ.",
  84004: "La a yiis bũmb ning sẽn be a pʋgẽ wã gilli, n lebg vɩʋʋgo.",
