  85009: "Sẽn so-a saasã la Tẽngã; lɑ Wẽnd yɑɑ bũmb ɑ fãa Seeta.",
  85010: "Ad neb nins sẽn nams-b muumin-roapã la muumin-pogsã, rẽ poorẽ tɩ b pa tuubi, ad Gεhannem naong bee ne-ba, la naon-yõogdg leb n bee ne-ba.",
  85011: "Ad neb nins sẽn kõ-b sɩdã la b tʋm sẽn sõmbã, Arzãn bee ne-ba, tɩ ko-sood zoet a tẽngrã, ad wãndã la paoong sẽn bedme.",
  85012: "Ad fo Soabã yõkrã yaa kεgenga.",
  85013: "Ad yaa Yẽ n sɩngd (naanegã) la A lebsdẽ.",
  85014: "Yẽ la Yaafda n yaa Noanga",
  85015: "N yaa Al-ars-zɩsgã Soaba,",
  85016: "N yaa maand ne A sẽn rat fãa.",
  85017: "Rẽ yĩnga tãpã kɩbar waa fo nengẽ?",
  85018: "a Fɩr-ʿaoon ne a Ṯamuud.",
  85019: "La neb nins sẽn kɩfl-bã bee yagsg pʋgẽ.",
  85020: "La Wẽnd yaool n gũbg-b-la gilli.",
  85021: "A pɑ wɑ bãmb sẽn yetã ye, Ad a yaa Alkʋrãan-zɩsgo",
  85022: "N be walg b sẽn gũus pʋgẽ.",
  86001: "M wẽn ne saagã la ne yʋng pukdã (ãdgã).",
  86002: "La bõe n wilg foom, bõe la yʋng pukdã.",
  86003: "Yaa ãd-witga.",
  86004: "Ad yõor fãa, a tara gũusda.",
  86005: "Bɩ ninsaal ges bõe la b naan ne-a.",
  86006: "B naan-a lame ne ko-tusdga.",
  86007: "A yita rɑo poorẽ ne pɑg kokolondẽ (yãoogã kõbɑ) sʋka.",
  86008: "Ad Yẽnda yaa tõogd ne a lebsgo.",
  86009: "Raar ning yεl-soondɩ sẽn na n vẽnege.",
