  86013: "Ad yãoã yaa welgr koεεga.",
  86014: "A pa reem ye.",
  86015: "Ad bãmbã rabsda rabre.",
  86016: "Tɩ Ma me rabsd rabre.",
  86017: "Bɩ f yaoolg kɩfr-dãmbã, yaoolg-b bilfu, lɑ f rɑ yãg ne b nɑngã lɑ b hɑlkrã ye.",
