  88009: "N yard a tʋʋmã.",
  88010: "N be arzãn-zẽkdg pʋgẽ.",
  88011: "B pa wʋmd gom-yood a pʋgẽ ye.",
  88012: "Ko-nin sẽn zoet bee a pʋgẽ.",
