  89014: "Ad fo Soabã yaa gũusda.",
  89015: "La sã n yaa ne ninsaala, a Soabã sã n wa zarb-a n na n gese, n waoog-a, n neem-a, la a sẽn yete: \"mam Soabã waooga maam\".",
  89016: "La A sã n wa zarb-a, n weoog a rɩtlã a zugu, la a sẽn yete: \"mam Soabã yaala maam\".",
  89017: "Pa woto ye! Y pa waoogd kɩɩb ye.",
